{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/80605-cover-and-infrastructure","id":80605,"title":"Cover and Infrastructure","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-26T16:31:01-08:00","id":80605,"title":"Cover and Infrastructure","content":"Could someone please clarify this for me or point out the page as I haven't been able to find anything in the book regarding it. From what I recall when an Angel falls the infrastructure that was maintaining it is torn out from the god machine and now works on maintaining the original cover, correct? I'm wondering how new covers gained by either soul pacts or patchwork pacts are maintained. Is it the same infrastructure that maintains the demons original cover or does new infrastructure just spring into existence to support it? Also do demons know exactly where their infrastructure is? I'd assume so, but again couldn't find any supporting reference in DtD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T16:56:39-08:00","id":80623,"title":"","content":"Well, I think its more that the new-Demon's infrastructure is more than torn out, its burned down into reality. There's nothing remaining of the original infrastructure beyond the Demon's cover. The occult matrix no that created / called the angel no longer exists.<br /> <br /> Demons don't operate on the same rules as Angels and the God Machine - their existence is more grounded in the world than the ephemeral angels. So, there's no infrastructure associated with their cover at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T16:58:54-08:00","id":80625,"title":"","content":"Their Cover is Infrastructure, it's just them-Infrastructure, like a Cipher or Bolthole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/936-erichzahn","name":"ErichZahn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-02T00:20:42-08:00","id":82538,"title":"","content":"Ah gotcha, I think I've just misinterpreted the dramatic failure of cover rolls. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demon: The Descent - page 115</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alternately, you may make two permanent glitch rolls (see p. 186) as the Infrastructure that maintains the character\u2019s Cover frantically tries (and fails) to fix her mistake.</div> </div> </div> </div> So I was thinking that there was still infrastructure out there maintaining the demons cover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}